      {
        "type": "prose",
        "text_ref": "在已接入能力目录的 AI 对话中直接描述用途，或在本站 Skills 页查入口；本机小工具可以用 `E:\\Tools\\LocalToolbox\\Find-LocalTool.ps1 -Query '<用途>' -Json` 按关键词查。具体运行仍由对应工具完成。",
        "row": "start",
        "width": "40%"
      },
      {
        "type": "source_text_card",
        "text_ref": "需要准备什么",
        "row": "start",
        "icon_position": "header_left",
        "header_icon": "_library/hires-icons/icon-clean-0432a3e02a060c22b01c.png"
      },
      {
        "type": "section_heading",
        "text_ref": "从开始到拿到结果",
        "row": "start",
        "width": "60%",
        "heading_icon": "_library/icons/scene-r3-exact-three-stairs.png"
      },
      {
        "type": "numbered_steps",
        "text_ref": "1. **按用途找入口**　AI 在能力目录或本机工具目录中找真实入口，告诉你需要的材料、账号或本机环境；查找本身不执行、不采集、不联网。",
        "row": "start",
        "columns": 1,
        "icons": "none",
        "illustration": "none",
        "connector": "none"
      }
